UnicodeMathML: LaTeX's math alphabets (\mathbb{R}) and plain TeX's matrices
(\pmatrix{...}) in TeX2UnicodeMath

Mathessible stores a LaTeX document's equations as LaTeX and builds them
through Murray Sargent's own LaTeX converter, TeX2UnicodeMath in the
playground's TeX.js. Two passes now run before its first one:

- TeXMathAlphabets: \mathbb{R}, \mathbf{v}, \mathcal{L} came out as the
  text "\mathbb" and a fenced R (upstream added these control words to
  src/unicodemathml.js only, ddba23c, and dist/, which TeX.js runs with,
  predates them). Their letters and digits become the Unicode math
  alphanumerics with dist's getMathAlphanumeric (ℝ, 𝐯, ℒ), \mathrm's
  quoted upright text, over any argument: \mathbf{\frac{a}{b}} is the
  fraction of 𝐚 and 𝐛; control words and \text{...} are kept.
- TeXMatrixCommands: \pmatrix{a&b\\c&d}, Word's \matrix{...} and the
  other plain TeX matrices threw (TeX2UMath's brace case destructures
  findClosingBrace, which returns a number at a row's \\). They become the
  environments it reads, \begin{pmatrix}...\end{pmatrix}, rows ended by
  \\ or \cr.
- TeXDocumentCommands: a .tex document's \label{...}, \tag{...},
  \nonumber and \notag, which are not math, are left out of the built
  equation (they came out as text).
- TeXNormDelimiters: \| built as a single bar, \left\| did not build,
  and amsmath's \lVert and \rVert were unknown; they become \Vert
  (U+2016), and \lvert, \rvert a bar.
- TeXSpaces: \;, \: and \> came out as punctuation, \ (a control
  space) and \qquad as errors, ~ as \sim and \! as a factorial. They
  become UnicodeMath's spaces of their widths (\, thin, \: medium, \;
  thick, \ and ~ a third of an em, \enspace, \qquad two quads); \! and
  the negative spaces are left out, UnicodeMath having none.
- amsmath's \boldsymbol and bm's \bm (bold italic letters and lowercase
  Greek, bold upright digits and capital Greek; \boldsymbol{\mathcal{L}},
  \boldsymbol{\mathfrak{g}}, \boldsymbol{\mathsf{A}} bold script, fraktur
  and sans), and a Greek letter's control word in any math alphabet
  (\mathbf{\Gamma}, \mathbf \Gamma), which kept its plain letter.

Only playground/assets/TeX.js, which Mathessible loads after dist/.
Applied by scripts/bootstrap.sh after 0001 to 0003.

